// Quiz for the Agile topic

::Agile model::
Which is NOT an advantage of the Agile development model
{
~It provides a realistic approach to the development of software.
=It requires many resources.
~It provides greater flexibility to software developers.
~It requires little planning.
}

::Agile model::
____ are short iterations, usually between one to three weeks to complete, where teams work on tasks.
{
~Milestones
~Efforts
=Sprints
~Backlogs
}

::Agile model::
A ____ is a high-level definition of a work request.
{
~Milestone
=User story
~Sprint
~Backlog
}

::Agile model::
As project requests are added through your intake system, they become outstanding stories in the ______.
{
=Backlog
~Repository
~Cloud
~Queue
}
